      "updated": 1772277452418,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A genetic algorithm is used in\ntimetable generation to\niteratively evolve optimal\nschedules by mimicking natural\nselection, minimizing conflicts\nand satisfying constraints like\nteacher availability, room\nallocation, and subject\ndistribution.",
      "fontSize": 54.77141476103061,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A genetic algorithm is used in timetable generation to iteratively evolve optimal schedules by mimicking natural selection, minimizing conflicts and satisfying constraints like teacher availability, room allocation, and subject distribution.",
